{"5089010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Night Kitchen", "steam_appid": 5089010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE NIGHT KITCHEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just started a new job. You're standing in a kitchen. Grill, oven, coffee machine. Take orders, prepare food, hand it to the customer. Simple work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/13126c87f3a8c6a210812452794e6277.poster.avif?t=1788293328\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/13126c87f3a8c6a210812452794e6277.webm?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/13126c87f3a8c6a210812452794e6277.mp4?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night is stranger than the last. The customers keep coming back. Their words don't fit this place. Or you. Or maybe they fit a little too well?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/eacd1e65fac30ba6a805fbaabbed2a2d.poster.avif?t=1788293328\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/eacd1e65fac30ba6a805fbaabbed2a2d.mp4?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kitchen never sleeps. And neither should you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you're here, the more you understand. But you're just not sure you want to. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/bee2e94aa826bcd1d678112b92e15bb8.poster.avif?t=1788293328\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/bee2e94aa826bcd1d678112b92e15bb8.webm?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/bee2e94aa826bcd1d678112b92e15bb8.mp4?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 nights</strong> - each one brings new customers, new equipment, and new tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing kitchen</strong> - grill, oven, deep fryer, coffee machine. With every night, you have more tools and more to cook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Familiar customers</strong> - the same customers return. And each time, they know a little more about you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/be27b02a152e928392ec87da5f1e459c.poster.avif?t=1788293328\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/be27b02a152e928392ec87da5f1e459c.webm?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/be27b02a152e928392ec87da5f1e459c.mp4?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE NIGHT KITCHEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just started a new job. You're standing in a kitchen. Grill, oven, coffee machine. Take orders, prepare food, hand it to the customer. Simple work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/13126c87f3a8c6a210812452794e6277.poster.avif?t=1788293328\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/13126c87f3a8c6a210812452794e6277.webm?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/13126c87f3a8c6a210812452794e6277.mp4?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night is stranger than the last. The customers keep coming back. Their words don't fit this place. Or you. Or maybe they fit a little too well?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/eacd1e65fac30ba6a805fbaabbed2a2d.poster.avif?t=1788293328\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/eacd1e65fac30ba6a805fbaabbed2a2d.mp4?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kitchen never sleeps. And neither should you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you're here, the more you understand. But you're just not sure you want to. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/bee2e94aa826bcd1d678112b92e15bb8.poster.avif?t=1788293328\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/bee2e94aa826bcd1d678112b92e15bb8.webm?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/bee2e94aa826bcd1d678112b92e15bb8.mp4?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 nights</strong> - each one brings new customers, new equipment, and new tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing kitchen</strong> - grill, oven, deep fryer, coffee machine. With every night, you have more tools and more to cook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Familiar customers</strong> - the same customers return. And each time, they know a little more about you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/be27b02a152e928392ec87da5f1e459c.poster.avif?t=1788293328\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/be27b02a152e928392ec87da5f1e459c.webm?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089010/extras/be27b02a152e928392ec87da5f1e459c.mp4?t=1788293328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The Night Kitchen is a psychological horror game. You just started a new job - the night shift in a kitchen. Grill, oven, deep fryer. Take orders, prepare the food, talk to the customer. Simple work. Seven nights. Each one stranger than the last.", "supported_lan